=== Ping.mk Button (не се користи) ===

Plugin Name: Ping.mk Button (не се користи)
Plugin URI: http://wp.mk/pingmk-kopce-verzija-2/
Author URI: http://wp.mk/
Author: Boris Kuzmanov
Requires at least: 3.0
Tested up to: 3.0.3
Version: 2.0

== Description ==

Ping.mk Button is WordPress plugin which enables users to share their posts to the Macedonian news aggregator Ping.mk.

=== Installation ===

Upload the "pingmk-button" folder to your WordPress plugin directory - /wp-content/plugins and active it from the Plugins menu in your WordPress Dashboard.

=== Screenshots ===

Visit any post on wp.mk to see the live presentation of this plugin.

